WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Willing volunteers are here. Can this drive run?

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:15.000
The organiser starts with a Hindi, English, or Hinglish task brief.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.500
AI proposes roles and shows the phrase behind each one. The organiser decides.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:30.000
The planner checks skills, availability, travel, consent, and standby cover.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.500
READY or NOT READY comes with exact gaps and recruit requests.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:45.000
A standby can replace someone in an essential role when they cannot attend.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.500
Host notes become draft cards. A host confirms or corrects them.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:01:00.000
A linked ledger records each decision. Evaluation stays clearly synthetic.
